{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"Self-Proclaimed Psychic: Reigen Arataka - And Mob\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-12\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Psychics fight with supernatural phenomena that cannot be explained by science. Reigen Arataka that runs the Spirits and Such Consultation office is one of those psychics... well, a fake one. His only hope is a super dull middle-schooler named Kageyama Shigeo, a.k.a. Mob. 27% towards Mob's explosion.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/307375/episodes/5f6904f1b5f58.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"自称霊能力者・霊幻新隆~とモブ~\"},{\"title\":\"Doubts About Youth: The Telepathy Club Appears\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-19\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"The Telepathy Club is told that they are going to be shut down by the student council due to lack of members. It was then that one of the members, Inukawa, thought of possibly getting Mob to join. However, Mob gets a call from Reigen about taking care of an incident at Highso Girls' Academy...\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/307375/episodes/5f69052c92263.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"青い春の疑問 ~脳感電波部登場~\"},{\"title\":\"An Invite to a Meeting: Simply Put, I Just Want to Be Popular\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-26\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"It's great that Mob joined the Body Improvement Club, but he suddenly faints as he's running along the riverside. His wish is to get stronger and to be able to get closer to his beloved Tsubomi-chan. One day, as Mob is feeling troubled, a woman with a strange mask approaches him... Progress toward Mob's explosion: 20%\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/307375/episodes/5f690b3dbaaae.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"集いへの誘い~簡単に言うとモテたい~\"},{\"title\":\"Idiots Only Event: Kin\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2016-08-02\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"After the incident with the religious organization (LOL), the evil spirit, Dimple, keeps following Mob around. Also, because of the incident, Mezato Ichi from the school paper starts following around Mob, as well. Then one day, another student joins the Body Improvement Club. Progress Towards Mob's Explosion: 45%\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/307375/episodes/5f69135550b9d.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"馬鹿オンリーイベント~同類~\"},{\"title\":\"Ochimusha: Psychic Powers and Me\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-08-09\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Mob is challenged to a one-on-one fight with Black Vinegar Middle School's shadow leader, Hanazawa Teruki, otherwise known as Teru. Mob doesn't use his powers but Teru goes all out on him, destroying everything around him. Teru continues to unleash his incredible power when Mob suddenly remembers a tragedy that happened between him and Ritsu...\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/307375/episodes/5f6921b8766f8.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"OCHIMUSHA~超能力と僕~\"},{\"title\":\"Discord: To Become One\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2016-08-16\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Peaceful days return after Mob's fight with Teru. As usual, Reigen continues to trick people as a fake psychic, and the president of the Telepathy Club, Kurata Tome, drags Mob around to find other espers. Then one day, a mysterious man talks to Mob's younger brother, Ritsu...\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/307375/episodes/5f6953dc6c4ad.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"不調和~成るために~\"},{\"title\":\"Exaltation: I`ve Obtained Loss\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2016-08-23\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Salt Middle School undergoes deep cleaning lead by the student council president, Kamuro, and one thug after another gets targeted. Meanwhile, the story about Mob defeating the shadow leader at Black Vinegar Middle School starts to get embellished and takes on a life of it's own, and Mob gets to be known as \\\"White T Poison.\\\" All of the gang leaders from the other schools start to gather at Salt Middle School to confront White T Poison. Also, Ritsu awakens to his dormant psychic powers, and Dimple manages to convince Ritsu to pair with him to become stronger than his brother. Ritsu finally gets to experience those powers for himself, but...\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/307375/episodes/5f69596493b14.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"昂揚~喪失を手に入れた~\"},{\"title\":\"The Older Brother Bows: Destructive Intent\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2016-08-30\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"After defeating all of the gang leaders from the surrounding schools, Ritsu feels omnipotent. And then, he's confronted by none other than his older brother, Mob. Mob knew that Ritsu had wanted psychic powers for a while, so he congratulates him. However Ritsu doesn't greet his brother with kindness. Meanwhile, a mysterious man watches the brothers from a distance. He easily manages to grab Ritsu, and tries to drag him off. Mob activates his powers in order to save his brother, but...\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/307375/episodes/5f695e48f2069.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"兄ペコ~破壊意思~\"},{\"title\":\"\\\"Claw\\\": 7th Division\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2016-09-06\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Ritsu and the others get abducted by a mysterious man named Koyama, and get taken to the secret organization Claw's 7th Division. Claw is an organization who is trying to lead the world to a better future by taking it over. One of Claw's assassins, Terada goes after Mob and Teru, but they overpower him and get him to tell them...\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/307375/episodes/5f69f490684bc.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"\\\"爪\\\"~第7支部~\"},{\"title\":\"The Heinous Aura: Mastermind\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2016-09-13\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Mob and Teru infiltrate the Claw's 7th Division to save Ritsu. Meanwhile, Ritsu tries to escape with the other esper kids and they run into the upper echelon and leader of the 7th Division. Teru and Dimple run into trouble after a strenuous battle, and the boss from Claw finally shows himself...\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/307375/episodes/5f69fc477f976.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"巨悪のオーラ~黒幕~\"},{\"title\":\"Master: Leader\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2016-09-20\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Mob, Ritsu, and Teru are trapped in a room where they can't use their powers. And then, someone rather unexpected shows up in front of them: Mob's master and self-proclaimed psychic, Reigen.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/307375/episodes/5f6a048085c3e.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"師匠~leader~\"},{\"title\":\"Mob and Reigen: A Giant Tsuchinoko Appears\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"2016-09-27\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Mob is finally pushed to his limit when he has to face Sakurai, Muraki, Matsuo and Ishiguro of the upper echelon. But then, he comes to a rather surprising decision...\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/307375/episodes/5f6a0b9b8d655.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"モブと霊幻~巨大ツチノコ現るの巻~\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":3600,"tags":[]}